    "# DML\n",
    "Data Manipulation Language. It manipulates the data within the table."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4fa48d2b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Create table\n",
    "```sql\n",
    "CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS review (\n",
    "\tid SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,\n",
    "\tcontent VARCHAR,\n",
    "\trating VARCHAR,\n",
    "\tuserId VARCHAR,\n",
    "\tproductId VARCHAR,\n",
    "\tcreatedAt TIMESTAMP\n",
    ")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
